{"n":104,"ar":"الهمزة","fr":"Les calomniateurs","type":"meccan","v":[["وَيۡلٞ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٖ لُّمَزَةٍ","Waylun likulli humazatin lumazatin","Malheur à tout calomniateur diffamateur"],["ٱلَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالٗا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","Allathee jama‘a malan wa‘addadahu","qui amasse une fortune et la compte"],["يَحۡسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","Yahsabu anna malahu akhladahu","pensant que sa fortune l'immortalisera"],["كَلَّاۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِي ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","Kalla layunbathanna fee alhutamati","Mais non! Il sera certes, jeté dans la Hutamah"],["وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","Wama adraka ma alhutamatu","Et qui te dira ce qu'est la Hutamah"],["نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","Naru Allahi almooqadatu","Le Feu attisé d'Allah"],["ٱلَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","Allatee tattali‘u ‘ala alafidati","qui monte jusqu'aux cœurs"],["إِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِم مُّؤۡصَدَةٞ","lnnaha ‘alayhim musadatun","Il se refermera sur eux"],["فِي عَمَدٖ مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","Fee ‘amadin mumaddadatin","en colonnes (de flammes) étendues"]]}